# Committed plans and bindings files are compared byte for byte by tests (PlansUpToDateTest,
# BindingsUpToDateTest), and sourceHash covers the scenario text: keep every text file on LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jar binary
# Phase 6 (phase6-contracts.md 9.1, D137): the Windows launcher and runner are CRLF in every checkout. These two lines
# must stay BELOW the LF rule above, because a later line overrides an earlier one (above it, the .bat would be checked
# out LF in every fresh clone); BatLauncherTest and LauncherIT depend on the order.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
